title: Koch-Weser resigns!
subtitle: The [+ ddp_name +] has slipped too far in the polls to be viable
new-page: true
view-if: chancellor = "Koch-Weser" and ddp_votes <= 2 and year >= 1928
max-visits: 1
tags: event
on-arrival: chancellor = "Brüning"; chancellor_party = "Z"

= Koch-Weser resigns

Due to the [+ ddp_name +]'s declining vote share, Zentrum has demanded chancellorship be transfered to them.
  
Chancellor Erich Koch-Weser has, already, agreed to these demands, but we could intervene and take the chancellorship ourselves.

- @intervene: Zentrum should not have chancellor, it was hard convincing them in the first place.
- @nothing: Let Brüning be.

@intervene
on-arrival: chancellor = "Wels"; chancellor_party = "SPD"; z_relations -= 6

Zentrum accepts, begrudgingly. 

@nothing


  
